## The quietest hour of the day

The beach is a four minute walk from reception, and at first light it belongs to almost nobody. Walk north towards Bloemendaal and the dunes rise on your right, still grey before the sun reaches them.

Ask at the desk the evening before and we will have coffee and something warm waiting for you when you get back.
